# Student Performance Prediction

## Overview
This project uses Machine Learning to predict student performance based on various academic factors such as study hours, attendance, and previous scores.

## Features
- Data preprocessing and cleaning
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Machine Learning model training
- Performance evaluation
- Student score prediction

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn

